	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Contacts of the flexible tail of the Tailor Pixels TOH095XVT-01 screen module (display_TOH095XVT-01.pdf PDF p5: tail 4.8 wide, contact block 3.2 long, 15 contacts numbered 15 to 1 left to right seen from the contact side, so pin 1 at the right; pin table of the same page: 1 ELVSS, 2 ELVDD, 3 MTP, 4 VCC, 5 IOVCC, 6 SWIRE, 7 TE, 8 RESET, 9 CS, 10 SCL, 11 RS, 12 SDA, 13 to 15 GND). Pitch 0.3 (4.8 tail = Hirose FH35C-15 recommended FPC width F 4.8, w1_hirose_fh35c_series_catalog.pdf p5) and pad width 0.15 (half the pitch) are not printed on the Tailor page. Seen from the contact side. Not a board part: the module is not placed on the ring board")
	(tags "FPC tail screen contacts")
